When you hit with a melee or arrow attack, there is a [26%, 35%, 40%, 44%, 46% (TL1-5)] chance that a warden will appear from another timeline to attack a random enemy.

The summoned warden will attempt a melee attack if you made an arrow attack, or an arrow attack if you made a melee attack.

These wardens are out of phase with your reality and deal [43%, 34%, 29%, 25%, 23% (TL1-5)] less damage, and their arrows will pass through friendly targets.

A warden can only be summoned this way once per turn and they return to their own timeline after attacking.
